<title>SINGAPORE: Datapulse sees 10 mln shares crossed.</title>
<headline>Datapulse sees 10 mln shares crossed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maker of diskette and audio-related products Datapulse Technology Ltd saw 10 million shares crossed at Singapore $0.72 after the lunch break on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0700 GMT, the shares were half a cent firmer, at S$0.74, with over 10.6 million shares traded.</p>
<p>Dealers said they were unaware if any of the directors were involved in the sale or of any fresh corporate developments at the company.</p>
<p>Datapulse officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
